    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "Pronouns used after prepositions (prepositional pronouns) correspond mostly to subject pronouns except for *mí* and *ti*, which replace *yo* and *tú* respectively. \nExamples include *conmigo* ('with me'), *contigo* ('with you'), *para nosotros* ('for us'), and *para ellos* ('for them')."
